{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">肥媽曾於節目《今個夏天食平D》中，教授大家製作一道「花生芽炒牛柳絲」。這道家常菜不僅做法簡單，更能完美保留花生芽爽脆、清甜及多汁的特點，搭配嫩滑的牛柳絲，口感層次極度豐富。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"603e1cd5-3fd0-4ab0-bddc-489556ec61f7.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20266FZ84TWktR1787196600.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"603e1cd5-3fd0-4ab0-bddc-489556ec61f7.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>食材：</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">花生芽（花生苗）</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">牛柳絲</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒜片與薑片</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蔥段</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">豆瓣醬</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>牛肉醃料：</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">麻油、油、糖、生抽、生粉</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>做法：</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>烹飪小貼士：</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"464ded73-9134-4fd1-8814-6f49a5e26b87.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ZOqEbuiw2s1787196600.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"464ded73-9134-4fd1-8814-6f49a5e26b87.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T09:58:00.785859+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}